# Modular NLP Pipeline Engineering

## Overview

This project demonstrates a modular Natural Language Processing (NLP) pipeline that transforms raw text into ranked similarity results. Instead of building one large script, the system is divided into independent, reusable modules that can be tested and maintained separately.

The pipeline performs:

1. Text Preprocessing
2. Text Vectorization
3. Similarity Computation
4. Ranked Result Generation

---

## Objective

Build a reusable NLP pipeline capable of:

- Cleaning and preprocessing raw text
- Converting text into numerical vectors
- Calculating similarity between queries and documents
- Returning ranked results with similarity scores
- Handling common edge cases gracefully

